1 NOTE {geni:about_me} VRISHAKETHU WAS THE ONLY SON OF KARNA WHO SURVIVED THE HORRIFIC SLAUGHTER. HE LATER CAME UNDER THE PATRONAGE OF THE PANDAVAS. DURING THE CAMPAIGN THAT PROCEDED THE ASHVAMEDHA-YAGNA, VRISHAKETHU ACCOMPANIED ARJUNA A
2 CONC ND PARTICIPATED IN THE BATTLES WITHSUDHAVA AND BABRUVAHANA. DURING THAT CAMPAIGN VRISHAKETHU MARRIED THE DAUGHTER OF KING YAVANATHA ( PERHAPS A KING OF THE WESTERN REGIONS). IT IS SAID, ARJUNA DEVELOPED GREAT AFFECTION FOR VRISHAK
2 CONC ETHU, HIS NEPHEW. ARJUNA MADE HIM KING OF ONE PART..
2 CONT
