1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Blessed to parents from a reputed Sri Lankan malay family, direct descendant of Prince Jebaye Doella. Gate Mudaliyar of Magampatthuwa, Baba Thajul Arifin Doole was born on 16 May 1796  with a long lineage represent
2 CONC ing the 2nd generation of Malays migrating from Sultanate of Mataram, Malaya during the dutch invasion cerca 1796. He was then appointed as the Gate Mudaliyar of Magampattuwa in 1868 served during the period of Leonard Wolf as the
2 CONC  Government Agent of Hambantota during the period of 1908 to 1911.
2 CONT
